                    <row><cell>On-Level Learners (Core)</cell><cell>Full activity and all examples. Assign <xref ref="ex-quartiles-seedlings"/> to <xref ref="ex-why-not-n-plus-one"/>.</cell></row>
                    <row><cell>Advanced Learners (Challenge)</cell><cell>All exercises including <xref ref="ex-missing-frequency-in-median-class"/>. Extension: estimate the 10th journey time by reading your graph from the activity in the previous section, and compare it with part (c) of the activity (they agree if the points were joined with straight lines).</cell></row>
                </tabular>
            </table>
        </axiom>

